---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/marketing/PageHero.astro';
import '../styles/pages.css';
---

<Layout
  title="Request access to FairMind | Agentic AI governance"
  description="Request access to FairMind: register your AI systems, run the release gate in CI, install packs for your frameworks, and run governance workflows that stop for a human decision."
>
  <div class="route-page">
    <PageHero
      signal="Request access"
      title="Start with one system and"
      accent="one gate."
      description="Tell us which systems you run, which frameworks you answer to, and where a decision gets stuck today. We will say plainly whether FairMind fits, and set up a pilot around one system if it does."
      proofs={[
        { label: 'Week one', value: 'A gated system', note: 'Registered, tested, and a verdict in your pipeline.' },
        { label: 'Week two', value: 'A pack installed', note: 'Workflows running with your people at the gates.' },
        { label: 'Leave with', value: 'A sealed run', note: 'Or a clear not-yet, with the reason written down.' },
      ]}
      primary={{ label: 'Describe your setup', href: '#access-form' }}
      secondary={{ label: 'See the platform', href: '/features/' }}
    />

    <section class="route-section" id="access-form" aria-labelledby="access-title">
      <header class="route-section-heading">
        <h2 id="access-title">A few specifics are enough.</h2>
        <p>No maturity questionnaire. These fields route you to the right first workflow.</p>
      </header>

      <div class="route-form-grid">
        <form class="route-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/xayzqjqw" method="POST">
          <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New FairMind access request" />
          <div class="route-field">
            <label for="firstName">First name</label>
            <input id="firstName" name="firstName" type="text" autocomplete="given-name" required />
          </div>
          <div class="route-field">
            <label for="lastName">Last name</label>
            <input id="lastName" name="lastName" type="text" autocomplete="family-name" required />
          </div>
          <div class="route-field">
            <label for="email">Work email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@organization.com" required />
          </div>
          <div class="route-field">
            <label for="company">Organization</label>
            <input id="company" name="company" type="text" autocomplete="organization" required />
          </div>
          <div class="route-field">
            <label for="jobTitle">Role</label>
            <input id="jobTitle" name="jobTitle" type="text" autocomplete="organization-title" placeholder="ML engineer, compliance lead, approver, auditor…" />
          </div>
          <div class="route-field">
            <label for="systems">AI systems in scope</label>
            <select id="systems" name="systems">
              <option value="">Select if useful</option>
              <option value="1-5">1–5</option>
              <option value="6-25">6–25</option>
              <option value="26-100">26–100</option>
              <option value="100-plus">100+</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="route-field route-field-wide">
            <label for="useCase">Where should we start?</label>
            <select id="useCase" name="useCase" required>
              <option value="">Choose the closest path</option>
              <option value="release-gate">Release gate in CI for a model</option>
              <option value="framework-journey">A framework journey (ISO 42001, EU AI Act, NIST AI RMF, AIUC-1…)</option>
              <option value="agentic-estate">Governing agents, tools, and MCP servers</option>
              <option value="india">DPDP, RBI FREE-AI, or NITI Aayog readiness</option>
              <option value="connector">Connecting MLflow, GitHub, or another source</option>
              <option value="research">Research or measurement collaboration</option>
              <option value="other">Something else</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="route-field route-field-wide">
            <label for="message">Describe the system and the decision</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="What is the system, who approves its release today, and which frameworks do you answer to?" required></textarea>
          </div>
          <div class="route-form-footer">
            <p>By submitting, you agree that we may use these details to respond. Read the <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
            <button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Request access</button>
          </div>
        </form>

        <aside aria-label="What happens next">
          <div class="route-aside-ledger">
            <div>
              <strong>01 · We check fit</strong>
              <p>Which packs and evaluators apply to your systems, and which steps a person still completes today.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>02 · We set up one system</strong>
              <p>A connector or a manual registration, the fairness test on your data, and the gate in your pipeline.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>03 · Your people take the gates</strong>
              <p>Approvers are named, the first workflow runs, and the first ledger is sealed.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="route-meta" style="margin-top: 1rem; color: var(--ink2); font-size: 0.9rem">Prefer email? <a href="mailto:support@fairmind.xyz">support@fairmind.xyz</a></p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
